- Marketing Pages Complete Implementation (2025-09-09)
  - Added About page with hero section, story, mission, and technology sections
  - Added Case Studies page with real campaign results and statistics
  - Added FAQ page with comprehensive accordion system and 12 key questions
  - Implemented Breadcrumb navigation component for better UX
  - Created FAQ system with FAQAccordion and FAQItem components
  - Added comprehensive FAQ data with marketing-focused content
  - All pages include SEO optimization, responsive design, and accessibility features
### Changed
- AboutScrollStack Component Complete Redesign (2025-01-27)
  - Replaced simple text rotation with interactive 4-step process cards
  - Added "How Mononio AI Works" section with Connect, Analyze, Optimize, Scale steps
  - Implemented ScrollStack integration with custom styling and animations
  - Added gradient backgrounds and animated indicators for each step
  - Enhanced responsive design with mobile-first approach
- ScrollStack Component Major Enhancement (2025-01-27)
  - Added "use client" directive for proper client-side rendering
  - Implemented browser-specific configuration system using `browserCompat.ts`
  - Added scroll chaining functionality with enableScrollChaining prop
  - Enhanced performance with transform caching and optimization
  - Added wheel event handling for better scroll experience
  - Improved z-index management and stacking behavior
  - Added backface visibility and perspective optimizations
  - Implemented boundary limiting for translateY on last card
- LogoCloud Component Responsive Design Overhaul (2025-01-27)
- AboutSection Content and Messaging Overhaul (2025-09-07)
  - Updated main title from "Mononio AI: Our Guiding Principles" to "Our Story. Our Promise"
  - Enhanced subtitle with more compelling marketing copy
  - Updated call-to-action from "Experience the Power of Our Principles" to "Ready For Your Own Marketing Seal Team"
  - Changed button text to "Start Your Journey Now"
- About Page Content Updates and CTA Enhancements (2025-01-27)
  - Updated differentiator description for "Professional Results Without Professional Prices"
  - Changed from "Get agency-level campaigns for 90% less cost" to "Get better results than agencies for 90% less cost"
  - Updated CTA button text from "Get Your Competitive Advantage" to "Stop Losing to Smarter Competitors"
  - Enhanced CTA description with urgency and competitive pressure messaging
  - Added "and eating your market share" to emphasize competitive threat
  - Implemented mobile-first responsive design with breakpoint-specific heights
  - Updated padding system from `py-12 sm:py-16` to `py-8 md:py-10 lg:py-12 xl:py-16`
  - Added conditional logo rendering for mobile devices (hides logos beyond index 5)
  - Optimized YouTube logo width from 160px to 140px for better visual balance
  - Complete CSS rewrite with responsive viewport and logo sizing system
  - Enhanced mobile experience with smaller logo heights and viewport adjustments
